{'symbol': 'ALK', 'date': '2023-01-26 06:00:00', 'title': 'ALASKA AIR GROUP DELIVERS STRONG FOURTH QUARTER 2022 AND FULL-YEAR RESULTS', 'text': 'DELIVERED INDUSTRY-LEADING FULL-YEAR ADJUSTED PRETAX MARGIN OF 7.6%;\xa0 RECORD ANNUAL REVENUE OF $9.6 BILLION, UP 10% VERSUS 2019;\xa0 EMPLOYEES HARD WORK RECOGNIZED WITH PERFORMANCE-BASED BONUSES TOTALING 10.5% OF ANNUAL PAY SEATTLE , JAN. 26, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- ALASKA AIR GROUP INC. (NYSE: ALK) TODAY REPORTED FINANCIAL RESULTS FOR THE FOURTH QUARTER AND FULL YEAR ENDED DEC.\xa031, 2022, AND PROVIDED AN OUTLOOK FOR THE FIRST QUARTER ENDING MARCH\xa031, 2023. "2022 WAS A YEAR OF SIGNIFICANT RECOVERY AND ACCOMPLISHMENT FOR ALASKA AIRLINES," SAID ALASKA AIRLINES CEO BEN MINICUCCI.'}